=saludable, c=moderado, d/e=no saludable)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "  (a/b=saludable, c=moderado, d/e=no saludable)", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13}, {"id": "4Rytd5mQz8VG0mC3Jjj3", "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1317543684, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1650031597, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1790504465330, "link": null, "locked": false, "type": "text", "x": 560, "y": 906, "width": 560, "height": 16.25, "text": "Si nutriscore es 'unknown' o falta → usar solo el semáforo", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Si nutriscore es 'unknown' o falta → usar solo el semáforo", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13}, {"id": "ftIr6jbkUXekdUTSHfmh", "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1304366370, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1934063544, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1790504465330, "link": null, "locked": false, "type": "text", "x": 560, "y": 930, "width": 560, "height": 16.25, "text": "Puntuación de preocupación (0-3 altos) es solo informativa", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Puntuación de preocupación (0-3 altos) es solo informativa", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13}, {"id": "24OT79D3sgUJPnwU7W9f", "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId":